ind]].`,`vn`:`Th\u1ea7y ch\u1ee7 nhi\u1ec7m, th\u1ea7y Long, ra t\u1eadn c\u1eeda \u0111\u00f3n c\u00f4. Th\u1ea7y \u00edt c\u01b0\u1eddi, nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u00f4i m\u1eaft th\u1ea7y r\u1ea5t hi\u1ec1n.`},{`en`:`[[Forty]] [[students|student]] [[look]] [[at]] [[her]] [[in]] [[the]] [[classroom]]. Trang's [[face]] [[goes|go]] [[red]]. [[She]] [[sits|sit]] [[next to]] [[a]] [[boy]] [[with]] [[funny]] [[hair]]. \`I'm Quoc,\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[This]] [[is|be]] [[the]] [[best]] [[class]] [[in]] [[the]] [[school]]. [[And]] [[the]] [[loudest|loud]].\``,`vn`:`C\u1ea3 l\u1edbp b\u1ed1n m\u01b0\u01a1i h\u1ecdc sinh quay ra nh\u00ecn c\u00f4. M\u1eb7t Trang \u0111\u1ecf b\u1eebng. C\u00f4 ng\u1ed3i c\u1ea1nh m\u1ed9t c\u1eadu b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 m\u00e1i t\u00f3c tr\u00f4ng r\u1ea5t bu\u1ed3n c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`T\u1edb l\u00e0 Qu\u1ed1c,\` c\u1eadu n\u00f3i. \`\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1edbp gi\u1ecfi nh\u1ea5t tr\u01b0\u1eddng. V\u00e0 c\u0169ng \u1ed3n nh\u1ea5t tr\u01b0\u1eddng.\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[first]] [[lesson]] [[is|be]] [[history]], [[and]] Quoc [[closes|close]] [[his]] [[eyes|eye]]. \`[[History]] [[is|be]] [[my]] [[sleeping|sleep]] [[time]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. [[The]] [[next]] [[subject]] [[is|be]] [[geography]]. [[The]] [[teacher]] [[puts|put]] [[a]] [[big]] [[chart]] [[on]] [[the]] [[wall]]. [[It]] [[shows|show]] [[rain]] [[in]] [[five]] [[cities|city]]. \`[[Which]] [[city]] [[has|have]] [[the]] [[most]] [[rain]]?\` [[Nobody]] [[answers|answer]].`,`vn`:`Ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ea7u l\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed, v\u00e0 Qu\u1ed1c nh\u1eafm m\u1eaft l\u1ea1i. \`Gi\u1edd l\u1ecbch s\u1eed l\u00e0 gi\u1edd ng\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a t\u1edb,\` c\u1eadu n\u00f3i. M\u00f4n ti\u1ebfp theo l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd. C\u00f4 gi\u00e1o treo m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ed3 l\u1edbn l\u00ean t\u01b0\u1eddng. Bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ed3 cho th\u1ea5y l\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u01b0a \u1edf n\u0103m th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1. \`Th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1 n\u00e0o m\u01b0a nhi\u1ec1u nh\u1ea5t?\` Kh\u00f4ng ai tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi.`},{`en`:`Trang [[puts|put]] [[her]] [[hand]] [[up]]. \`Hue. [[It]] [[rains|rain]] [[a]] [[lot]] [[in]] [[my]] [[city]].\` \`[[Very]] [[good]]!\` [[says|say]] [[the]] [[teacher]]. Trang [[smiles|smile]] [[for]] [[the]] [[first]] [[time]] [[today]].`,`vn`:`Trang gi\u01a1 tay. \`Hu\u1ebf \u1ea1. Th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1 em m\u01b0a nhi\u1ec1u l\u1eafm.\` \`Gi\u1ecfi l\u1eafm!\` c\u00f4 gi\u00e1o khen. L\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean trong ng\u00e0y, Trang m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi.`},{`en`:`[[After]] [[lunch]], Mr Long [[teaches|teach]] [[the]] [[class]]. Quoc [[has|have]] [[no]] [[pen]], [[so]] Trang [[gives|give]] [[him]] [[her]] [[pencil]]. [[He]] [[draws|draw]] Mr Long [[on]] [[a]] [[piece]] [[of]] [[paper]], [[with]] [[a]] [[very]] [[big]] [[head]]. Mr Long [[sees|see]] [[it]]. \`[[Not]] [[bad]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[But]] [[my]] [[head]] [[is|be]] [[bigger|big]].\` [[Everybody]] [[laughs|laugh]].`,`vn`:`Sau b\u1eefa tr\u01b0a, th\u1ea7y Long l\u00ean l\u1edbp. Qu\u1ed1c kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 b\u00fat, n\u00ean Trang \u0111\u01b0a c\u1eadu c\u00e2y b\u00fat ch\u00ec c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. C\u1eadu v\u1ebd th\u1ea7y Long l\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u1ea9u gi\u1ea5y, v\u1edbi c\u00e1i \u0111\u1ea7u to t\u01b0\u1edbng. Th\u1ea7y Long b\u1eaft g\u1eb7p b\u1ee9c v\u1ebd. \`Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ec7,\` th\u1ea7y n\u00f3i. \`Nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ea7y c\u00f2n to h\u01a1n th\u1ebf.\` C\u1ea3 l\u1edbp c\u01b0\u1eddi \u1ed3.`},{`en`:`[[He]] [[gives|give]] [[them]] [[homework]]. \`[[Study]] [[pages|page]] [[ten]] [[to]] [[twenty]], [[and]] [[learn]] [[them]].\` [[He]] [[looks|look]] [[at]] Trang. \`[[Come]] [[to]] [[my]] [[room]] [[after]] [[school]] [[tomorrow]]. [[I]] [[want]] [[to]] [[see]] [[what]] [[you]] [[know]].\` [[What]] [[does|do]] [[he]] [[want]]?`,`vn`:`Th\u1ea7y giao b\u00e0i t\u1eadp v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0. \`C\u00e1c em h\u1ecdc t\u1eeb trang m\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1ebfn trang hai m\u01b0\u01a1i, h\u1ecdc cho thu\u1ed9c nh\u00e9.\` Th\u1ea7y nh\u00e